Ramflux is a product brand of Span Brain.

This repository contains the AGPL-3.0-or-later desktop client for Ramflux. It
depends on the BSD-3-Clause Ramflux core workspace maintained in the
ramfluxhq/ramflux repository.

This product includes GPUI Kit (https://github.com/longbridge/gpui-kit) and
GPUI, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

This product bundles the following fonts, each licensed under the SIL Open
Font License, Version 1.1 (full texts in the licenses/ directory):

- Hanken Grotesk, Copyright 2021 The Hanken Grotesk Project
  Authors (https://github.com/marcologous/hanken-grotesk).
  License: licenses/OFL-HankenGrotesk.txt
- Noto Sans SC (official SC subset), Copyright 2014-2021 Adobe
  (http://www.adobe.com/), with Reserved Font Name 'Source'.
  License: licenses/OFL-NotoSansSC.txt

Both are shipped as static Regular (400), Medium (500) and SemiBold (600)
instances made with fontTools from the upstream variable fonts; the glyphs
are unmodified.
